#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Fcron"
msgstr "Instalação do &quot;Fcron&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Fcron</application> uses the cron facility of "
"<command>syslog</command> to log all messages.  Since LFS does not set up "
"this facility in <filename>/etc/syslog.conf</filename>, it needs to be done "
"prior to installing <application>Fcron</application>. This command will "
"append the necessary line to the current "
"<filename>/etc/syslog.conf</filename> (perform as the <systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"<application>Fcron</application> usa o recurso &quot;cron&quot; do "
"<command>syslog</command> para registrar todas as mensagens. Como o LFS não "
"configura essa facilidade em <filename>/etc/syslog.conf</filename>, isso "
"precisa ser feito antes de instalar o <application>Fcron</application>. Esse"
" comando anexará a linha necessária ao <filename>/etc/syslog.conf</filename>"
" atual (realize como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class='username'>root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/syslog.conf"
msgstr "/etc/syslog.conf"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/syslog.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin fcron addition to /etc/syslog.conf\n"
"\n"
"cron.* -/var/log/cron.log\n"
"\n"
"# End fcron addition</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; /etc/syslog.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Começo da adição do \"fcron\" ao /etc/syslog.conf\n"
"\n"
"cron.* -/var/log/cron.log\n"
"\n"
"# Fim da adição do \"fcron\"</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The configuration file has been modified, so reloading the "
"<command>sysklogd</command> daemon will activate the changes (again as the "
"<systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem> user)."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo de configuração foi modificado, de modo que recarregar o processo "
"de segundo plano <command>sysklogd</command> ativará as mudanças (novamente "
"como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem>)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:124
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>/etc/rc.d/init.d/sysklogd reload</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>/etc/rc.d/init.d/sysklogd reload</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For security reasons, an unprivileged user and group for "
"<application>Fcron</application> should be created (perform as the "
"<systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem> user):"
msgstr ""
"Por razões de segurança, um(a) usuário(a) e um grupo sem privilégios para "
"<application>Fcron</application> deveriam ser criados (realize como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class='username'>root</systemitem>):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 22 fcron &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -d /dev/null -c \"Fcron User\" -g fcron -s /bin/false -u 22 fcron</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>groupadd -g 22 fcron &amp;&amp;\n"
"useradd -d /dev/null -c \"Usuário(a) Fcron\" -g fcron -s /bin/false -u 22 fcron</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "Now fix some locations hard coded in the documentation:"
msgstr "Agora corrija alguns locais codificados rigidamente na documentação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>find doc -type f -exec sed -i 's:/usr/local::g' {} "
"\\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>find doc -type f -exec sed -i 's:/usr/local::g' {} "
"\\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fcron</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Fcron</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var   \\\n"
"            --without-sendmail     \\\n"
"            --with-boot-install=no \\\n"
"            --with-systemdsystemunitdir=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr         \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc      \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var   \\\n"
"            --without-sendmail     \\\n"
"            --with-boot-install=no \\\n"
"            --with-systemdsystemunitdir=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"            --without-sendmail   \\\n"
"            --with-piddir=/run   \\\n"
"            --with-boot-install=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"            --without-sendmail   \\\n"
"            --with-piddir=/run   \\\n"
"            --with-boot-install=no &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:166
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:169
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"DESTDIR install must be done as <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user. Furthermore, if PAM configuration"
" files should be installed in <filename class=\"directory\"> "
"/etc/pam.d</filename>, you have to create this directory in the DESTDIR "
"before doing the install."
msgstr ""
"A instalação &quot;DESTDIR&quot; precisa ser feita como usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>. Além disso, se os arquivos"
" de configuração &quot;PAM&quot; devessem ser instalados em <filename "
"class=\"directory\"> /etc/pam.d</filename>, [então] você tem de criar esse "
"diretório no &quot;DESTDIR&quot; antes de fazer a instalação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:182
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:190
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--without-sendmail</parameter>: By default, "
"<application>Fcron</application> will attempt to use the "
"<command>sendmail</command> command from an <xref linkend=\"server-mail\"/> "
"package to email you the results of the <command>fcron</command> script.  "
"This switch is used to disable default email notification. Omit the switch "
"to enable the default. Alternatively, you can use the <option>--with-"
"sendmail=<replaceable>&lt;/path/to/MTA command&gt;</replaceable></option> to"
" use a different mailer command."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--without-sendmail</parameter>: Por padrão, "
"<application>Fcron</application> tentará usar o comando "
"<command>sendmail</command> originário de um pacote <xref linkend=\"server-"
"mail\"/> para te comunicar os resultados do &quot;script&quot; "
"<command>fcron</command>. Essa chave é usada para desabilitar a notificação "
"padrão de mensagem eletrônica. Omita a chave para habilitar o padrão. "
"Alternativamente, você pode usar o <option>--with-"
"sendmail=<replaceable>&lt;/caminho/para/comando "
"&quot;MTA&quot;&gt;</replaceable></option> para usar um comando de "
"comunicador diferente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-boot-install=no</parameter>: This prevents installation of"
" the bootscript included with the package."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-boot-install=no</parameter>: Isso impede a instalação do "
"&quot;script&quot; de inicialização incluído no pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-piddir=/run</parameter>: This fixes the systemd unit to "
"use the proper directory for PID files so that systemctl does not hang and "
"the unit starts correctly."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-piddir=/run</parameter>: Isso corrige a unidade do "
"&quot;systemd&quot; para usar o diretório apropriado para arquivos "
"&quot;PID&quot;, de modo que o &quot;systemctl&quot; não trave e a unidade "
"inicie corretamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: This prevents "
"building the <application>systemd</application> units, which are not needed "
"for a <application>SYS V</application> system."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-systemdsystemunitdir=no</parameter>: Isso evita construir "
"as unidades do <application>systemd</application>, que não são necessárias "
"para um sistema <application>SYS V</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:218
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-"
"editor=<replaceable>&lt;/path/to/editor&gt;</replaceable></option>: This "
"switch allows you to set the default text editor."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-"
"editor=<replaceable>&lt;/caminho/para/editor&gt;</replaceable></option>: "
"Essa chave te permite configurar o editor padrão de texto."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/fcron.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-dsssl-dir=<replaceable>&lt;/path/to/dsssl-"
"stylesheets&gt;</replaceable></option>: May be used if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> installed.  Currently, the dsssl stylesheets are"
" located at <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-"
"stylesheets-1.79</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-dsssl-"
"dir=<replaceable>&lt;/caminho/para/folhas_de_estilo_dsssl&gt;</replaceable></option>:"
" Possivelmente seja usado se você tiver <xref linkend=\"docbook-utils\"/> "
"instalado. Atualmente, as folhas de estilo &quot;dsssl&quot; estão "
"localizadas em <filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/sgml/docbook/dsssl-"
"stylesheets-1.79</filename>."

